    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24a472595aa8a4461923abd4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Bueno──！那么中山前辈，\n今天训练结束后就由小神鹰我\n来为你上堂法语课吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f23f4b516b618eec4c702011f25f2dfac289ac2c579a27a6228b4ad5b1e5bf50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
