      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e9e78a24d9626768df0d96c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我再去问问爸爸还有没有更多\n庆典的影片。无论什么资讯都好，\n希望有助于未来的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "696101f008f4ce1c0bbb5ecbecb72182f64d686b37314c54407f352f4d1d83f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f5e8d9a100b75a003986a53",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山以前的导师",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcf2afed461feb158f394be1b92d4df633a8b8308f0c3283812d3a319b1356ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049113.json",
      "json_path": [
